--- META ---
name: 64-bit numbers survive JSON
summary: GetLargeNumbers returns int64/uint64 maxima as strings, without precision loss
tags: [types, numbers]

--- ENDPOINT ---
types.TypeService/GetLargeNumbers

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "name": "large"
}

--- RESPONSE ---
{
  "large_int64": "9223372036854775807",
  "large_uint64": "18446744073709551615",
  "very_large_int64": "9223372036854775807",
  "very_large_uint64": "18446744073709551615"
}
